    "notes": "The current terms exclude U.S. users from becoming Protocol Users, while strUSD acquisition is expressly not offered in the EU/EEA/U.S.; that separate strUSD exclusion is not applied to trUSD. trUSD remains a dollar-tracking, transferable synthetic token, but the binding terms deny mandatory repurchase and allow discretionary repurchase below USD 1 or at zero, leaving payment-stablecoin applicability unresolved despite NAV-redemption marketing. The public reserve dashboard exists, but its disclaimer says neither HT Digital nor RockawayX has published an attestation on the displayed figures. No public 1:1 redemption entitlement or monthly reserve attestation was identified. No token-specific GENIUS approval, application or foreign registration was found. DASP not-yet-restricted describes GENIUS timing; it is separate from the issuer's current U.S. access exclusion.",
