      "summary": "As of 2026-10-07, no public GENIUS PPSI approval, state qualification, official GENIUS application or foreign-exception registration naming Tori (BVI) Limited or trUSD was found in the consulted federal, NYDFS and issuer materials and targeted regulator-domain searches. The issuer's general terms state that the company and its affiliates are not registered with any financial regulatory body except as disclosed on its website. No relevant authorization disclosure or issuer-specific enforcement action was found. These are bounded public-source findings, not a conclusion that no non-public filing exists.",
